# Staged, not committed.
#
# `make mac-stage-corpus` copies bundles/gutenberg-all/swift into this folder
# before a release build, so the notarized Mac app ships the corpus inside it.
# `make mac-build` stages it itself. The folder is committed empty so that
# `make mac-check` and CI compile against an existing-but-empty path rather
# than a missing one; XcodeGen fails the build outright on a folder reference
# that does not exist.
#
# CorpusPacks.bundledDirectory() treats a folder with no manifest.json as
# "this build has no corpus", which is exactly the empty case.
